  _periodsDescriptions:
  - period: 0
    description: This cape was usually worn by <b>prehistoric</b> people to survive
      the cold of Ice Age
  - period: 1
    description: After a time paradox, this cape became a current bedside rug during
      <b>Antiquity</b>.
  - period: 2
    description: After a time paradox, this cape is now commonly worn by <b>knights</b>.
  - period: 3
    description: After a time paradox, this cape is now worn by <b>nobles</b>, especially
      old ladies, as a sign of wealth.
